      "writtenOn": "2023-01-05T23:24:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s correct. `1` is a magic number that\u0027s hardcoded elsewhere. Maybe that should come from caps too to make it a bit more fool proof but afaik Graphite follows the same pattern as Ganesh, where descriptor set 0 holds the UBO and SSBO bindings and set 1 holds textures and samplers.\n\nI updated the comment above to be more specific.",
      "parentUuid": "8703cb2b_e63aa49d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 232,
        "startChar": 71,
        "endLine": 232,
        "endChar": 76
      },
